				</TRBLOCK>
				<TRBLOCK name="OutBlock1" occurs="30" inout="out" _len="574" _ulen="444" >

ISCD^종목코드^12^0^0^0^0^0^0
LOAN_DATE^대출 일자^8^0^0^0^0^0^0
INT_RCKN_DATE^이자 기산 일자^8^0^0^0^0^0^0
